6:// The one filter shape, shared by every read surface.
7://
8:// One vocabulary means one thing to learn: a consumer who can express a
9:// subscription can express a query and a projection without translating. It is
10:// also what makes the filter-before-decode guarantee expressible — every field
11:// here lives on the envelope **frame**, so matching never touches `data`.
