474:## 8. Delivery rules (repeat in every lane and every PR)
476:- Yeet is the only publish path: `bun run beep yeet publish --start-pr-early --monitor --pr --message "..."`,
477:  then `bun run beep yeet monitor` until `merge-ready: yes`; answer every review thread via
478:  `bun run beep yeet reply`; never merge unless Benjamin asks.
479:- Merge `origin/main` into the branch before every publish (stale-base guard); never force-push.
480:- Commit trailers: `Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>`; PR footer:
481:  `🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)`.
482:- Attribute red checks before repairing; a `Coverage Regression` red on an untouched package is
483:  never fixed by writing its baseline from this branch.
484:- Docgen: `bun run docgen:local` in edit loops; JSDoc on every new export per
485:  `.patterns/jsdoc-documentation.md` (titled **Example** sections, never `@example`).
486:- Every workspace package a lane edits gets `bun run beep quality package-verify <@beep/pkg>`
487:  before handoff.
