## Reusable knowledge

- Preserve `R extends JsonlEvent.Registry` at the engine boundary. Event definitions own typed envelope codecs; derive `EnvelopeUnion<R>` from them. Use a typed `Context.Service<Self, JournalShape<R>>()(id)` facade augmented over the runtime implementation rather than casting a finished class to `JournalClass<Self, Id, R>`. Effect `Rpc.ts` is a facade-pattern reference, not a license to reproduce its internal casts. [Task 1]
- Focused source audit over 11 JSONL files reported zero unsafe assertions, non-null assertions, explicit `any`, const assertions, native `Map`/`Set`, or `JSON.parse`/`JSON.stringify`; baseline is local commit `805dc4af4d40f04d238eccde63d4836c88e31ef7` on `fix/jsonl-effect-first`, based on `origin/main` `9e95b9a6e8`. [Task 1]
- `S.optionalKey` models omission only; `S.optional` permits omission or explicitly present `undefined`. In this module, defaults/filter fields use `optionalKey`; no `S.optional` usages remained after updating `Slice.ts` and `Journal.ts`. Do not mechanically rewrite internal `?: ... | undefined` arguments or overloads without a separate contract decision. [Task 2]

